164 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 120 0 R
/T (Air is the most immediate human necessity, yet the way we understand its quality remains limited. While air pollution is a major public health concern in India, most systems today only present Air Quality Index \(AQI\) values without meaningful interpretation. These numbers fail to communicate real-world impact, leaving citizens and decision-makers without clarity on causes, risks, or actions. This disconnect between data and understanding creates a critical need for systems that can translate air quality data into actionable intelligence.)
/E (Air is the most immediate human necessity, yet the way we understand its quality remains limited. While air pollution is a major public health concern in India, most systems today only present Air Quality Index \(AQI\) values without meaningful interpretation. These numbers fail to communicate real-world impact, leaving citizens and decision-makers without clarity on causes, risks, or actions. This disconnect between data and understanding creates a critical need for systems that can translate air quality data into actionable intelligence.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
165 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 120 0 R
/T (Sanjeevan addresses this gap by transforming raw air quality data into meaningful, actionable intelligence. Instead of only displaying AQI values, it combines air quality data with weather patterns & contextual signals to provide source-level insights, short-term forecasts, and personalized guidance. The system is designed to be simple, explainable, & usable in real-world scenarios, helping citizens make informed decisions while enabling policymakers to better understand & respond to pollution dynamics.)
/E (Sanjeevan addresses this gap by transforming raw air quality data into meaningful, actionable intelligence. Instead of only displaying AQI values, it combines air quality data with weather patterns & contextual signals to provide source-level insights, short-term forecasts, and personalized guidance. The system is designed to be simple, explainable, & usable in real-world scenarios, helping citizens make informed decisions while enabling policymakers to better understand & respond to pollution dynamics.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
