/Title (Sanjeevan addresses this gap by transforming raw air quality data into meaningful, actionable intelligence. Instead of only displaying AQI values, it combines air quality data with weather patterns & contextual signals to provide source-level insights, short-term forecasts, and personalized guidance. The system is designed to be simple, explainable, & usable in real-world scenarios, helping citizens make informed decisions while enabling policymakers to better understand & respond to pollution dynamics.)
